Strategy promise to the audience
title end

paragraph start
The promise is what a viewer can count on every time: the kind of value, the tone and how often. It is short enough to remember and small enough to keep every week.
paragraph end

paragraph start
A broken promise costs more than a missing one, so promise only what the weekly routine can deliver.
paragraph end

